      "id": "answer_9",
      "label": "Answer",
      "default": "<p>Care instructions are included with each product. Generally, we recommend gentle cleaning and proper storage to maintain quality.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Question 10"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "question_10",
      "label": "Question",
      "default": "How can I contact customer support?"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "answer_10",
      "label": "Answer",
      "default": "<p>You can reach our customer support team via email, phone, or live chat. We're available Monday-Friday, 9 AM - 6 PM.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
